                            <p class="text-base tracking-[0.01em] lg:text-lg font-light mb-5 md:mb-0 text-black">
                                National Cereals and Produce Board (NCPB) is a commercial State Corporation under the Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock, Fisheries and Cooperatives. The Board’s mandate is to provide logistics support services to the government on food security matters
                                and to carry out market intervention for grains and farm inputs on behalf of the government.
                            </p>
